stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Idle
    Idle --> Run: horizontal input
    Run --> Idle: released / slowed
    Idle --> Jump: jump
    Run --> Jump: jump
    Jump --> Idle: land without input
    Jump --> Run: land while moving
    Idle --> Sit: crouch while powered
    Run --> Slide: fast direction reversal
    Slide --> Idle: slowed
    Sit --> Idle: stand
    Idle --> Grow: Small + Mushroom
    Run --> Grow: Small + Mushroom
    Grow --> Idle: install Giant form
    Idle --> Shrink: Giant / Fire damaged
    Run --> Shrink: Giant / Fire damaged
    Shrink --> Idle: install Small form
    Idle --> Dead: lethal event
    Run --> Dead: lethal event
    Jump --> Dead: lethal event
    Idle --> Cheer: goal activated
    Run --> Cheer: goal activated
    Dead --> [*]
    Cheer --> [*]
